CHAPTER.VERS:
And Dovid said, "Let their shulchan 

          table
         become a snare and a net, a trap and a retribution for them;

For I do not want you to be unaware, Achim b'Moshiach, of this raz 

          mystery
        , lest you be wise in your own estimation, that a hardening in part has come over Yisroel, until the full number of the Goyim has come in;

For G-d has confined all in disobedience in order that He might have chaninah 

          mercy
         on all;
